am/apps/1281320/extras/d4ee216db3d0b3bbcae141f1feac7ea4.webm?t=1779076216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/extras/d4ee216db3d0b3bbcae141f1feac7ea4.mp4?t=1779076216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normally in Lucky Heroes, your deck will be randomly made in every round depends on the character's level you are playing. All you have to do is just focus on newly made decks every single round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Heroes supports local play. Since the decks are not open to all players, two players can play with one device.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connect and play everywhere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky Heroes will support multi-platform. You can interlock the play data from one device to another.</p>", "short_description": "Find A SINGLE CARD which leads you to the victory. Lucky Heroes is a very simple and easy card game. Explore and manipulate decks with 20 unique characters.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/fac38242f2d7530ff0bbd2b9c99958097705c433/header.jpg?t=1779076216", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/73b8c1d28f8f59b3e85bf33d9a8f85c5ffdb8262/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779076216", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1281320/73b8c1d28f8f59b3e85bf33d9a8f85c5ffdb8262/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779076216", "website": "https://www.sinkholestudio.com/lucky-heroes", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.2Ghz or faster Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro